 PROCEDURE DIVISION.
     MOVE "T" TO TL-MODE
     MOVE "acceptance US12 30-1§7 Redstone ore: interact (7): spawnParticles, then a lit false ore becomes lit true (particles, set lit)" TO TL-CASE
     PERFORM BEGIN-CASE
     MOVE "0" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "RS1-ORE-INTERACT" USING WS-I1 WS-R1 WS-R2
     MOVE 2 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "RS1-ORE-INTERACT" USING WS-I1 WS-R1 WS-R2
     MOVE 2 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "1/1 1/0" TO TL-EXPECTED
