     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
     PERFORM ADD-N
     MOVE "0 1 0 0.3" TO WS-IN
     PERFORM LOAD-IN
     CALL "RS1-ORE-COORD" USING WS-I1 WS-I2 WS-FX4 WS-R1
     MOVE 1 TO WS-N
